      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 105</b></color></size>\n<b>The Great Bath, Mohenjo-daro</b>\n<size=74%>c. 2500 BCE\n<i>Fired brick, gypsum mortar and bitumen; about 12 \xD7 7 m, 2.4 m deep</i>\nIn situ, Mohenjo-daro, Sindh (UNESCO World Heritage Site)</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nOn Mohenjo-daro's raised citadel lies a watertight brick tank with steps at both ends. Its bricks were set in gypsum mortar and sealed with a layer of bitumen. It may have been used for ritual bathing \u2013 an early sign of the importance of water and purity in South Asian religion.</size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 723364797c8904a93956dad57186ed9d, type: 2}
